anklin-county"],["ARC or PLC in Franklin County","/arc-plc/missouri/franklin-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Franklin County has a record of 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. On that middle, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 43% of normal in August to September and 44% in November to December. The 2026 year started the same way, with January to February at 44% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
